            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Ba Son",
            "review_text": "Ken Ryan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam394 contributions\n0\nGood experience\nSep 2023 • Solo\nLocation: Located near the intersection of Ong Doi bridge on Nguyen Luong Bang street.\n---------------------\nSpace: Indoor & outside. Clean, polite & airy.\n⚠️There is parking on the sidewalk in front of the shop. Guests should remember to lock their cars carefully.\n---------------------\nStaff: Mostly aunts and uncles. They are quite welcoming and friendly with guests 😊\n--------------------\nPrice: I had breakfast with fried rice for 55k and came back the same evening to enjoy a free bowl of Sa Dec noodle soup😉\n\n⚠️If anyone lives in this Phu My Hung area, they will probably find the price reasonable. As for people from other areas, I think it will be a bit high😕\n--------------------\nQuality: Delicious food❤️. Everything is very ok👍\n--------------------\nYou can refer to it below!👇\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 8, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
