            "review_text": "thadgoff\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nNew favorite restaurant for HCMC and PMH residents!\nSep 2013 • Family\nThe BEST 'local' restaurant in Phú Mỹ Hưng! Opened less than a month ago this new family-owned and operated restaurant is already the Talk of the Town! Great location (near international schools) which is already attracting local PMH residents with its delicious broken rice dishes and barbeque meats! YUMMY! I knew it was well managed when I personally checked out the spotless kitchen AND THE CLEANEST BATHROOM IN ALL OF SAIGON! Service was also great and you won't believe the very reasonable prices!! When you're hungry for a good quality breakfast or lunch then I highly recommend this unique, new restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 27, 2013",
